        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chas Chandler, John Constantine, Alan Moore, Steve Bissette, John Totleben\n- Companies: DC Comics, Vertigo\n- Roles: sidekick, cab driver, antihero, creators\n- Publications: comic books, The Saga of the Swamp Thing\n\nFacts:\n- John Constantine first appeared in The Saga of the Swamp Thing No. 25 in June 1984.\n- Alan Moore, Steve Bissette, and John Totleben created John Constantine.\n- John Constantine is a fictional antihero who appears in comic books published by DC Comics and its alternative imprint Vertigo.\n- Chas Chandler is John Constantine's closest and longest surviving friend.\n- Chas Chandler acts as John Constantine's sidekick and cab driver.",
